<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenCreateFromInteger</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to create a token representing an
    integer</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoToken *SilikoTokenCreateFromInteger(long long int source);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenCreateFromInteger</function> function
creates a new <type>SilikoToken</type> representing the integer
passed as <varname>source</varname>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoTokenCreateFromInteger</function> returns a
pointer to the newly created <type>SilikoToken</type> object if
successful, or <literal>NULL</literal> on failure.</para>
</refsection>
